{"seq":4,"slug":"integration","title":"第四章：工程集成实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cicd-performance-gates","title":"CI/CD 性能门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/integration/cicd-performance-gates","wordCount":692,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"chaos-performance","title":"混沌工程与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/integration/chaos-performance","wordCount":795,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"production-load-testing","title":"生产环境负载测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/integration/production-load-testing","wordCount":1198,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第四章-工程集成实践\">第四章：工程集成实践</h1><p>性能测试的最大价值，在于将其嵌入日常开发流程中——让性能回归像代码 lint 一样自动发现，让生产环境测试像金丝雀发布一样受控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>核心价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>4.1 CI/CD 性能门禁</td>\n<td>代码提交时</td>\n<td>防止性能回归进入生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4.2 混沌工程与性能</td>\n<td>故障注入时</td>\n<td>验证降级场景的性能表现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4.3 生产环境负载测试</td>\n<td>生产流量中</td>\n<td>真实条件下的持续验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"集成成熟度模型\">集成成熟度模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    L1[L1: 手工测试] --&gt; L2[L2: CI 自动化]&#10;    L2 --&gt; L3[L3: 性能门禁]&#10;    L3 --&gt; L4[L4: 混沌+性能]&#10;    L4 --&gt; L5[L5: 生产持续测试]\">graph LR\n    L1[L1: 手工测试] --&gt; L2[L2: CI 自动化]\n    L2 --&gt; L3[L3: 性能门禁]\n    L3 --&gt; L4[L4: 混沌+性能]\n    L4 --&gt; L5[L5: 生产持续测试]</pre><p>大多数团队从 L2 开始，逐步演进到 L3。L4/L5 需要更高的基础设施成熟度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置要求\">前置要求</h2><p>需要已有可运行的负载测试脚本（第 2 章）和基本的指标体系（第 1 章 §1.3）。CI/CD 集成需要有对应的流水线平台。</p>\n"}